# Implementation Tasks - Phase 3: Configurations & Architecture

## Task List

- [x] Task 1: Configurable Port Support (#92)
  - [x] 1.1 Support `PORT` (and `APP_PORT`) env variable in `backend/src/app.ts` (default 3000)
  - [x] 1.2 Support `PORT` env variable in `docker/start.sh` and `nginx/server.conf` template (default 80)
  - [x] 1.3 Verify custom port binding in backend and Docker startup

- [x] Task 2: Reverse Proxy Base Path Support (#88)
  - [x] 2.1 Configure `router.base` and Axios `baseURL` in `frontend/nuxt.config.js` via `ROUTER_BASE_PATH` (default `/`)
  - [x] 2.2 Configure Koa routes in `backend/src/app.ts` to mount under `ROUTER_BASE_PATH`
  - [x] 2.3 Update Nginx reverse proxy configuration in `nginx/server.conf` and `docker/start.sh` to route prefix requests
  - [x] 2.4 Verify asset loading and API calls under custom base path

- [x] Task 3: Multi-Profile Support (#96)
  - [x] 3.1 Implement profile manager and cache in `backend/src/profiles.ts` supporting `TASK_PROFILES`
  - [x] 3.2 Update `backend/src/taskwarrior.ts` and route handlers to resolve profile from `X-Taskwarrior-Profile` header or query
  - [x] 3.3 Add `GET /config/profiles` endpoint in backend
  - [x] 3.4 Add profile state in Vuex store (`frontend/store/index.ts`) and Axios interceptor for `X-Taskwarrior-Profile`
  - [x] 3.5 Add Profile switcher component/menu in `frontend/layouts/default.vue`
  - [x] 3.6 Verify switching between profiles reloads tasks and queries with correct `TASKRC`/`TASKDATA`

- [x] Task 4: Taskwarrior Contexts Support (#18)
  - [x] 4.1 Implement `backend/src/contexts.ts` with `GET /config/contexts` (`task _context`, `task _get rc.context`) and `POST /config/contexts`
  - [x] 4.2 Support `X-Taskwarrior-Context` header in backend CLI executions for request-level context override
  - [x] 4.3 Add context state and actions in Vuex store (`frontend/store/index.ts`)
  - [x] 4.4 Add Context switcher menu/badge in `frontend/layouts/default.vue`
  - [x] 4.5 Verify listing, switching, and clearing active context in UI

- [x] Task 5: Sub-projects Hierarchical Filtering (#43)
  - [x] 5.1 Add "Include subprojects" toggle in `frontend/pages/index.vue`
  - [x] 5.2 Implement hierarchical matching in `filteredTasks` (`task.project === selected || task.project.startsWith(selected + '.')`)
  - [x] 5.3 Persist subproject toggle state in URL query `?subprojects=1`
  - [x] 5.4 Ensure hierarchical filtering applies consistently across Tasks, Kanban, and Gantt views

- [x] Task 6: Final Integration and Build Verification
